Revision history for ASPEER-MakeMaker-Markdown-Pod

1.014  2026-09-26

    - Refer only to the public GitHub repository in installation guidance.

1.013  2026-09-26

    - Publish public repository metadata through the GitHub mirror.
    - Add contributor and security policies, dependency auditing and
      artifact-attestation verification guidance.
    - Declare the CPAN authority in distribution metadata.

1.012  2026-09-26

    - Separate reusable Markdown processing from MakeMaker integration.
    - Add DocBook discovery and sidecar-driven documentation targets.
    - Leave the markpod command with Markdown-Pod-Embed.
    - Prepare the MakeMaker adapter for its first CPAN release.
    - Install pandoc in GitHub Actions for documentation integration tests.
